   "fix": "Add `@[simp] toFreeAlgebra_X : toFreeAlgebra R \u03b9 (X R \u03b9 i) = FreeAlgebra.\u03b9 R (i, false)` and `@[simp] toFreeAlgebra_star_X : toFreeAlgebra R \u03b9 (star (X R \u03b9 i)) = FreeAlgebra.\u03b9 R (i, true)`.",
