   "file": "TauCeti/Algebra/Star/StarPolynomial.lean",
   "fix": "Add `theorem withStar_def (a : \u03b9 \u2192 A) (x : \u03b9 \u00d7 Bool) : withStar a x = bif x.2 then star (a x.1) else a x.1 := (rfl)`.",
